    <x:String x:Key="MainWindow.Dialog.Agreement.Title">BedrockBoot User Agreement</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="MainWindow.Dialog.Agreement.Content">Welcome to BedrockBoot.&#x0a;By using this software, you agree to the following terms:&#x0a;&#x0a;1. This is an unofficial Minecraft launcher.&#x0a;2. You must own a legally licensed copy of Minecraft; otherwise, it will default to Trial Mode.&#x0a;3. We do not support or assist in any bypass of Minecraft's official licensing.&#x0a;4.Any form of piracy or cheating is strictly prohibited.&#x0a;5. Use Mods/Resource Packs at your own risk.&#x0a;6. Not affiliated with Mojang / Microsoft.&#x0a;7. This software will modify registry-related configurations.&#x0a;8. This is open-source software; use and distribution must follow the GPL-v3 license.&#x0a;&#x0a;Continuing to use the software constitutes acceptance of these terms.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="MainWindow.Dialog.Agreement.Agree">I Agree</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="MainWindow.Dialog.Agreement.Decline">I Decline, Exit</x:String>

