    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Main.Title">Master Switch</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Main.Desc">The feature will only take effect when the master switch is turned on</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Advance">Advanced</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.ForGdk.Title">Enable for GDK Version</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.ForGdk.Desc">Normally, only the UWP version requires mouse lock</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Reserve.Title">Legacy Logic</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Reserve.Desc">You should not enable this switch unless the new mouse lock logic does not work as expected</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Reserve.Warn">The legacy mouse lock logic is more aggressive. Aside from unnecessary CPU overhead, it may also cause issues with the built-in mouse locking of other applications or games,&#10;and may cause the unlock hotkey to malfunction.&#10;You really should not enable this switch unless the new mouse lock logic fails to work as expected!&#10;&#10;Are you sure you want to enable it?</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.WindowTrimming.Title">Border Trimming Pixels</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.WindowTrimming.Desc">Trim a small number of pixels around window edges to prevent misclicks on the taskbar in fullscreen or maximized mode with hidden taskbar</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Title">UWP Window Capture Priority</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Desc">Configure the UWP frame window capture strategy.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Default">Monitor frame on launch</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.GetFrame.Legacy">Get frame from game</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Hotkey.Title">Hotkey Binding</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Hotkey.Desc">Bind a hotkey to temporarily release the mouse lock</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Settings.Game.MouseLock.Hotkey.Capturing">Capturing... Press Esc to cancel</x:String>

    <!-- Multiplayer -->
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.Title">Overview</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.GravityConeDesc">GravityCone is third-party open-source software. If you encounter any problems, please submit feedback through related channels.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.P2PDesc">This multiplayer service is based on the PaperConnect v2 protocol and uses P2P technology. Once connected, users in the room connect directly to each other without third-party relay servers. The multiplayer experience depends on network conditions.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.ComplianceDesc">During multiplayer gameplay, please strictly comply with all laws and regulations in your country or region.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.PaperConnectDesc">This multiplayer service is based on PaperConnect with relay powered by EasyTier.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.PaperConnectP2PDesc">Uses P2P technology for multiplayer. After connection, room members connect directly to each other without third-party relay servers. The multiplayer experience depends on network conditions.</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.LinksTitle">Related Links</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.DocsTitle">Related Documentation</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.Link.Protocol">PaperConnect Protocol</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.Link.GravityConeRepo">GravityCone Repository</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.Link.PaperConnectRepo">PaperConnect Repository</x:String>
    <x:String x:Key="Multiplayer.Intro.Link.EasyTierWebsite">EasyTier Official Website</x:String>

